      "role_note": "terminal (Onda) — wire as pre-step to any instrument script",
      "narration_text": "Wire the lock as the first line of any instrument script so no probe runs without a locked prediction. Ask Claude to add a --require flag: if predlock.log has no locked entry in the last twenty-four hours, exit with code one and print 'No prediction locked — run predlock lock first.' Then show a bash wrapper that enforces it before every probe runs.",
